message: >-
  If you use CATSS-TF software in your research, please cite it using these
  metadata. CATSS, BHSA, and LXX datasets have separate upstream citation and
  licensing requirements.
type: software
title: 'CATSS-TF: CATSS Hebrew-Greek alignment materializers for Text-Fabric'
authors:
  - family-names: Sosnovshchenko
    given-names: Oleksandr
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-09-26'
repository-code: https://github.com/alexsosn/CATSS-TF
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Software for materializing user-acquired CATSS Hebrew-Greek parallel
  alignments as a standalone Text-Fabric corpus and as BHSA/LXX projection
  modules. The software does not redistribute the upstream datasets.
